  "description": "The 8bar KRZBERG has been around since 8bar bikes was founded and was our first frame model. This is where it all started. It is now in its seventh generation.\n\nThe 8bar KRZBERG v7 stands for speed and exceptional design. The frame was developed with German engineering. With its aggressive and unique low pro geometry, it is designed for fast and agile riding! This makes it perfect for urban cycling in cities like Berlin, but also for fast fixed gear racing.\n\nAll KRZBERG bikes are pure fixed-gear or singlespeed bikes – a declaration of love to the roots of 8bar!\n\nHIGH-QUALITY STANDARDS\n\nIn order to meet our high-quality standards, the frame is made exclusively of high-quality materials: it is crafted from triple-butted 6061 lightweight aluminium, which makes it stiff, light and durable at the same time.\n\nSTIFFNESS IN CHARGE\n\nA tapered head tube gives the 8bar KRZBERG v7 enormous stiffness in the steering area.\n\nWIDER TIRES WELCOME\n\nWide tire clearance up to 30mm for frame and fork for better comfort.\n\nCUSTOM DROPOUTS\n\nCustom dropouts with 8bar logo and double-sided stainless steel plates.\n\nPOLISHED LOGO\n\nPolished 8bar logos on top and head tube.",
